analogue gain; dark current 0.043 e-/p/s at +20 C (lower when cooled to -5 C \
air / -40 C liquid); full well 9.5 ke- at lowest gain (16-bit HDR mode \
combines both). 2x2 charge-domain (floating-diffusion) binning on chip, \
further binning is digital.\>\""}]}], "|>"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
