Cell["\<\
How the three definitions separate with molecule number, at 1x1 binning. The \
gain from optimal weighting is largest exactly where the measurement is \
hardest (read-noise limited, few molecules) and vanishes once signal shot \
noise dominates, where the flat sum is already optimal.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"79763d3c-896b-4a66-933d-03395f464618"],

