Cell["\<\
The actionable summary: how many molecules are needed before the cloud is \
visible in one shot, as a function of binning. Lower is better. The blue line \
is the working point of 10^4 molecules; any camera/binning combination whose \
curve lies below it shows the MOT in a raw frame.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"802c617d-c902-4998-8976-ef33bc95e6e8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"visibilityThresholdPlot", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"series", ",", " ", "plotOptions"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
